# "When Mutagen Man enters, create X Mutagen tokens": X is the X of the spell that became it (CR 107.3m). Cast with
# X = 1 it makes one Mutagen; blinked by Ephemerate on turn 3 it enters again, was not cast, and its X is 0, so it
# makes none (CR 107.3i). It has trample all along.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mutagen Man, Living Ooze
Ephemerate
Plains
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Mutagen Man, Living Ooze.Cast(X: 1)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Mutagen Man, Living Ooze; Mutagen Token
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ephemerate.Cast(Mutagen Man, Living Ooze)

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 1
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Mutagen Man, Living Ooze; Mutagen Token
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutagen Man, Living Ooze.Keywords = Trample
